{"about_the_game":"As a time traveler agent equipped with VR physical controls<br>You'll embark on a captivating journey through diverse and meticulously crafted levels<br>Unleash your arsenal of unique abilities as you navigate through challenges<br>From manipulating time to harnessing special powers<br>You'll need to adapt and strategize to overcome the obstacles that lie in your path<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8db3b51c9d680f624d6910eebcffa6e2.webp?t=1747212314\" width=594 height=18 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/72200c7eca72923f61cfa4be00044a72.webp?t=1747212314\" width=168 height=21 /></span><br>Make wise decisions as you navigate challenging levels, carefully utilizing your special abilities and power-ups <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/c7fb07961fe54efd25b11c4afec21ed4.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/c7fb07961fe54efd25b11c4afec21ed4.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/c7fb07961fe54efd25b11c4afec21ed4.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into a world where every action feels intuitive, natural and FUN<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/995aad02beb01fb97dc3c239e943c8d2.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/995aad02beb01fb97dc3c239e943c8d2.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/995aad02beb01fb97dc3c239e943c8d2.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in stunning environments that are meticulously crafted with attention to detail<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8b4cbdf8e6e11504985d79885763cc7b.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8b4cbdf8e6e11504985d79885763cc7b.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8b4cbdf8e6e11504985d79885763cc7b.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Progress through each run to discover new and powerful enhancements<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/b6705e768e81adb6dff945de75bb524f.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/b6705e768e81adb6dff945de75bb524f.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/b6705e768e81adb6dff945de75bb524f.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2092670?t=1747212314","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2092670?t=1747212314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app